  message: "HUMAN RULING (2026-06-16): keep route LOGICAL in spirit, WIDEN the key — add language + app/package root so within-app urls.py+views.py still dedup but cross-app/cross-language do NOT. Coupled metric decision RULED: INV-tazaj closure metric counts SITE-axis + declaration kinds only; LOGICAL-axis by-design dedup (route, message_queue, event_sourcing) EXCLUDED. This item becomes the route-key-widening implementation, shipped in the one atomic v7->v8 bump alongside WI-napoh (call_site SITE-key) + WI-bolup (CBV-method). Design note: 'app/package root' must distinguish express's 33 example apps (one manifest) while preserving Django urls.py+views.py dedup — exact scope-component formula to be pinned in design (manifest-scope vs handler-identity vs path-root); language fold is unconditional (fixes the gin-Go+express-JS cross-language collision). needs_human_review -> todo_hard (decided)."  # 0364
